DuoMath Native Mobile App APK Placeholder.

To generate the real APK file and make it downloadable here:
1. Open the 'DuoMathMobile' project in Android Studio or use React Native CLI.
2. Build the release APK by running:
   cd DuoMathMobile/android
   ./gradlew assembleRelease
3. Copy the resulting APK from 'DuoMathMobile/android/app/build/outputs/apk/release/app-release.apk' to 'duosteam/frontend/public/duomath.apk'.
